Type: Package
Package: deckifyr
Title: Declarative, Code-First PowerPoint Compiler
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("John", "Prybylski", email = "jprybylski@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5802-0539"))
URL: https://github.com/jprybylski/deckifyr, https://jprybylski.github.io/deckifyr/
BugReports: https://github.com/jprybylski/deckifyr/issues
Description: Generates .pptx presentations from version-controlled YAML
    and content files. Design tokens, logical layouts, and presentation
    content are validated and composed as separate schemas. Supports
    reportifyr's `{rpfy}:` magic-string artifacts and Quarto content
    fragments. This R package is a thin orchestration facade: schema
    validation, merging, resolution, and PPTX composition all live in
    the bundled Python engine under inst/python/deckifyr/, invoked via
    'pyro'. See deckifyr-specification.md at the repository root for the
    full design.
Imports:
    pyro,
    jsonlite,
    cli,
    utils,
    processx
